{
  "name": "rsi_dip_dxy_weak_riskon_sol_avax_link",
  "rationale": "High-beta alt reversion needs a macro liquidity tailwind: buy RSI oversold on SOL/AVAX/LINK names when the dollar is weakening (dxy cross_down) inside a favourable macro_regime. Thesis: oversold high-beta bounces hardest when USD liquidity is loosening. DISCONFIRMER: the dxy-weakening cross is the control \u2014 if the oversold edge is identical when DXY is strengthening, the dollar-tailwind thesis is false and it reduces to plain alt dip-buying.",
  "catalyst": "RSI oversold while DXY crosses down through its trend in a risk-on macro",
